e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −2 to +3 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1975","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-pittsburgh-steelers","name":"Pittsburgh Steelers","code":"PIT","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 142)","str":84.7,"squad":[["Terry Bradshaw","QB",95],["Joe Gilliam","QB",54],["Franco Harris","RB",94],["Rocky Bleier","RB",78],["Lynn Swann","WR",89],["John Stallworth","WR",77],["Frank Lewis","WR",73],["Reggie Garrett","WR",71],["Larry Brown","TE",74],["Randy Grossman","TE",62],["Gordon Gravelle","OL",89],["Jim Clack","OL",89],["Jon Kolb","OL",89],["Gerry Mullins","OL",79],["Ray Mansfield","OL",79],["Mike Webster","OL",57],["Sam Davis","OL",57],["Ernie Holmes","DL",86],["Dwight White","DL",85],["L.C. Greenwood","DL",82],["Steve Furness","DL",71],["Joe Greene","DL",70],["John Banaszak","DL",62],["Jack Ham","LB",91],["Andy Russell","LB",87],["Jack Lambert","LB",87],["Mel Blount","CB",99],["J.T. Thomas","CB",84],["Jimmy Allen","CB",65],["Dave Brown","CB",59],["Mike Wagner","S",90],["Glen Edwards","S",84],["Donnie Shell","S",59],["Roy Gerela","K",96]]},{"id":"nfl-los-angeles-rams","name":"Los Angeles Rams","code":"LAR","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 146)","str":83.3,"squad":[["James Harris","QB",83],["Ron Jaworski","QB",60],["Lawrence McCutcheon","RB",88],["Jim Bertelsen","RB",81],["Harold Jackson","WR",91],["Ron Jessie","WR",80],["Jack Snow","WR",65],["Willie McGee","WR",64],["Bob Klein","TE",71],["Terry Nelson","T